{"id":"n554236f64d","headline":"Iran war has cost $38 billion, depleted two-thirds of US missile interceptors, CBO says","summary":"A new Congressional Budget Office analysis finds US combat operations against Iran have cost about $38 billion. The military has also depleted two-thirds of its missile interceptors.","why":"The Congressional Budget Office is the nonpartisan analyst for US Congress, and its cost estimates shape federal spending and defence budget debates. Large military outlays can affect US deficits and defence industry demand.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Washington, D.C.","country":"United States of America","lat":38.9,"lon":-77.04,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Air Force TImes","url":"https://www.airforcetimes.com/news/your-air-force/2026/09/15/iran-war-has-cost-38-billion-depleted-two-thirds-of-us-missile-interceptors-cbo-says/"},"sources":[{"name":"Air Force TImes","url":"https://www.airforcetimes.com/news/your-air-force/2026/09/15/iran-war-has-cost-38-billion-depleted-two-thirds-of-us-missile-interceptors-cbo-says/"}],"published_at":"2026-09-15T19:52:56Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T00:21:16Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"148fcf38f88e1d63","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T00:21:16Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-15T19:52:56Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-16T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"CH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-1265254.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"hpgruesen","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https:/